\title{bayesvis: Extended Bayesian Visualization Diagnostics}
\description{
A companion/extension prototype for the \pkg{bayesplot} package. Provides
advanced visualization tools for diagnosing Bayesian models:
\itemize{
\item \code{mcmc_shrinkage()}: Prior-to-posterior shrinkage diagnostic scatter plot
\item \code{compute_shrinkage()}: Helper to compute shrinkage factors from draws
\item \code{ppc_pit_hist()}: LOO probability integral transform histogram
\item \code{ppc_pit_qq()}: LOO-PIT quantile-quantile plot with envelope
\item \code{mcmc_rank_ecdf()}: Rank-based ECDF plots per chain with simultaneous bands
\item \code{ppc_coverage()}: Posterior predictive coverage plot
